      "notes": [
        "spec/results.md. expected.qualifiers is an EXACT array in the spec-defined order, compared after stripping x- vendor entries from the result. Several vectors verify the same capsule bytes under different host configurations (per-vector allowlist, accept_versions) — the host-relative qualifiers are facts about THIS verification. The encrypted vector pins encrypted_outer_only as per-result: lanes with L3 decrypt the same bytes and must not find it on the inner result.",
        "The two capability mechanisms coexist (spec/results.md): the encrypted vector's requires:['encryption'] gates what a plain-only lane RUNS, while the same lane's runtime verdict for such a capsule — 'unsupported' with verdict_reason 'unsupported_capability' — is pinned on real encrypted fixtures by its tamper-detection consumer (sdk-kotlin: SpecRegistryTest.assertEncryptedRefused)."
      ]
